    {
      "block_id": "F_zl1z0ex6dSxM25ZBUWk",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:page",
      "content": [
        "Write, Draw, Plan all at Once."
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": null,
      "parent_block_id": null,
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"edgeless\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "U8g2Edcy8rSmu_XUpYSTz",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "ClickDz Work is an open source all in one workspace, an operating system for all the building blocks of your team wiki, knowledge management and digital assets and a better alternative to Notion and Miro. "
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "NxvF6M1Zo-TrUoJyFbMy4",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        ""
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "VHVvola5BtXnC7FMaGzE7",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "You own your data, with no compromises"
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "Hvbw1lSZ7Bl-LMiOc_xFb",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "Local-first & Real-time collaborative"
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2N8pJ32byPEc7dlJv-0cC",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "We love the idea proposed by Ink & Switch in the famous article about you owning your data, despite the cloud. Furthermore, ClickDz Work is the first all-in-one workspace that keeps your data ownership with no compromises on real-time collaboration and editing experience."
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "rysuvULJQgFPRmNB_iTk3",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "ClickDz Work is a local-first application upon CRDTs with real-time collaboration support. Your data is always stored locally while multiple nodes remain synced in real-time."
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "zbvmiGhuxn0_tfJ_e4N2V",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        ""
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"omG6fe87r60dPxCtv_Odb\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "CQeQaaREQwGDXg9oAng4q",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "Blocks that assemble your next docs, tasks kanban or whiteboard"
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "QqLfbOIINoAxapnB23E5t",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"QqLfbOIINoAxapnB23E5t\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "RTtZAHZG4xoAXKKnEsRhB",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "There is a large overlap of their atomic \"building blocks\" between these apps. They are neither open source nor have a plugin system like VS Code for contributors to customize. We want to have something that contains all the features we love and goes one step further. "
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "c_KFpzTBHdioeoIsnLIjd",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "We are building ClickDz Work to be a fundamental open source platform that contains all the building blocks for docs, task management and visual collaboration, hoping you can shape your next workflow with us that can make your life better and also connect others, too."
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "O6D7PxXwCbfCLp1_peft1",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "If you want to learn more about the product design of ClickDz Work, here goes the concepts:"
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "os84XIVFN6z6aN9tq16S5",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "To Shape, not to adapt. ClickDz Work is built for individuals & teams who care about their data, who refuse vendor lock-in, and who want to have control over their essential tools."
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"Fpxp7rZCad7-W51xCWta1\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "8jk1eREgtKdhwtee0nym-",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "A true canvas for blocks in any form"
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "sfycWDfMpgKsE7s5qucWr",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"sfycWDfMpgKsE7s5qucWr\"}"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "kDyc-RntYCDWSSYFl4SSn",
      "flavour": "ClickDz Work:paragraph",
      "content": [
        "Many editor apps claimed to be a canvas for productivity. Since the Mother of All Demos, Douglas Engelbart, a creative and programable digital workspace has been a pursuit and an ultimate mission for generations of tool makers. "
      ],
      "blob": null,
      "ref_doc_id": null,
      "ref_info": null,
      "parent_flavour": "ClickDz Work:note",
      "parent_block_id": "sfycWDfMpgKsE7s5qucWr",
      "additional": "{\"displayMode\":\"page\",\"noteBlockId\":\"sfycWDfMpgKsE7s5qucWr\"}"
    },
    {
